#: src/Admin/Settings/Schema.php:185
msgid "How often anyone hears from you"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings/Schema.php:186
msgid "Caps that apply to a person, not to a basket. They are the difference between a reminder and a nuisance, and on WhatsApp they are the difference between a working sender and a blocked one."
