#: src/Admin/Settings/Schema.php:408
msgid "How messages are sent"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings/Schema.php:409
msgid "RecoveryFlow can hand a journey to a WA.cr Auto Flow and let WA.cr do the messaging, or send each message itself on the schedule in the workflow."
