#: src/Admin/Settings/Schema.php:419
msgid "Sending each message from WordPress"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings/Schema.php:421
msgid "Handing over works on every WA.cr plan and puts the timing and the wording in WA.cr. Sending from WordPress keeps both here and needs a workspace that can use the WA.cr developer API."
msgstr ""

